    "created_at": "2023-05-25T16:59:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-25T16:59:12Z",
    "body": "Why should the author explicitly choose `none` to indicate that they do not agree? What is meant by the absence of this type of metadata?\r\n\r\nDoesn't this sentence duplicate [the existing](//html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage#link-type-license) `license` link type? Interested parties can already create a mechanism like [CC REL](//wiki.creativecommons.org/CC_REL) and provide the appropriate legal background, this is an organizational issue, not a technological one.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
