    "updated_at": "2023-05-25T18:24:29Z",
    "body": "By the way, if you leave it in force something similar to DNT, you [can](//microformats.org/wiki/process) move [the proposal](//microformats.org/wiki/existing-rel-values) to the Microformats Wiki (which will be [officially](//html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage#concept-rel-extensions) recognized as a specification), or go with the same to [WICG](//wicg.io). Also, bikeshedding: something like `notraining` and `nosnipping` would sound more “vanilla”.",
